<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_pruned_first" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">EmbodMocap: In-the-Wild 4D Human-Scene Reconstruction
<br class="ltx_break">for Embodied Agents
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Wenjia Wang
