<a href="#S4.SS1.p1.1" title="4.1 Ablation Study on Loss Functions ‣ 4 Evaluation ‣ EmbodMocap: In-the-Wild 4D Human-Scene Reconstructionfor Embodied Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§4.1</span></a>.
</span></li>
